  "updated_at": "2026-03-18",
  "bio": "Ink Assassins Tattoos, nestled in the heart of Erie, offers a sanctuary for lovers of traditional tattoo artistry since the turn of the millennium. Renowned in the Northwestern Pennsylvania region for both tattoos and piercings, this studio encapsulates a legacy of precision and bold aesthetic. Walk-in or call; no direct messages, please – become a canvas for the masters at Ink Assassins, where every mark is a masterpiece.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Erie, Pennsylvania, United States"
